{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁愛離世｜<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">資深演員梁愛（愛姐），今日（16日）驚傳離世消息，享年87歲。報道指，梁愛於今年7月8日在內地一家養老院內因病安詳辭世。</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁愛在演藝生涯中參演無數影視作品，其樸實自然的演出令廣大觀眾留下深刻印象。然而，去年她不幸確診胰臟癌，性格豁達的愛姐在面對病魔時，選擇以坦然的態度應對，並決定拒絕接受化療。隨著病情的發展，梁愛的身體狀況每況愈下，體重更一度急降至不足70磅，消瘦身軀令人痛心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0fb55b11-2d3a-496e-a609-e331092dba75.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026j5gniUgjrL1784198137.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0fb55b11-2d3a-496e-a609-e331092dba75.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">為了得到更完善的照顧，梁愛早前決定移居內地，入住深圳的一所養老院接受全天候護理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">著名製作人楊紹鴻與梁愛相交多年，兩人感情深厚。過往楊紹鴻不但每年親自為她慶祝生辰，平日亦會抽空前往探望。早前，楊紹鴻前往探訪時，曾拍下兩人交談的相片。相中可見，當時患病的梁愛已需依靠輪椅出入，雖然鏡頭僅拍到其側面，但已明顯見到她臉頰凹陷，體型極為消瘦，楊紹鴻則全程半蹲在旁，耐心地與她傾談。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9b33c193-d7de-4814-920a-fc5f7e76a2bd.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jFpPMG14jb1784198142.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9b33c193-d7de-4814-920a-fc5f7e76a2bd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">梁愛在生前接受楊紹鴻訪問時，曾坦言確診後身體每況愈下，甚至逐漸失去基本的生活自理能力。她無奈表示雙腳嚴重乏力，行動極為不便，並感慨病痛帶來的沉重折磨，形容當時的狀態為「一步一驚心」，更提到身體不適的感受：「膊頭係凍嘅，隻腿成日發熱，好淒慘。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T10:58:56.945421+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}